<title>THAILAND: Siam City Bank 6-mth unaudited net 1.82 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Siam City Bank 6-mth unaudited net 1.82 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited six months ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				     For six months</p>
<p>				     1997	   1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		   3.02	   1.43</p>
<p>    Net			1,816.32     1,718.90</p>
<p>NOTES: The comparison figures for 1996 are audited as the unaudited figures are unavailable. Company's full name is Siam City Bank Bank Plc. The company is a commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
